---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = "October 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — HackerSpace Technologies"
  description="Privacy Policy for HackerSpace Technologies (HST). Learn how we handle information, data privacy, and security."
  theme="dark"
>
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-[#000000] text-white border-b border-white/10 bg-grid-subtle-dark">
    <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-hst-red font-bold">
          Legal &amp; Compliance
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm font-mono text-neutral-400">
          Effective Date: {lastUpdated} • Version 1.1
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-[#000000] text-neutral-300">
    <div class="max-w-reading mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
          1. Introduction &amp; Commitment to Data Privacy
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          HackerSpace Technologies (“HST”, “we”, “our”, or “us”) respects the fundamental right to individual privacy. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, process, and protect information when you visit our official digital headquarters at <a href={siteConfig.url} class="text-hst-red hover:underline font-mono">{siteConfig.url}</a> or communicate with us through our contact channels.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          We operate under a strict principle of <strong>data minimization</strong>: we do not sell personal information, we do not deploy invasive third-party ad retargeting pixels, and we collect only the minimal information required to facilitate legitimate business inquiries.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          When you interact with our website, we may collect the following categories of information:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-400">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-neutral-200">Voluntary Inquiry Information:</strong> When you submit a message through our inquiry form, we collect your name, email address, optional organization name, inquiry category, and message text.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-neutral-200">Technical Log Data:</strong> Like most static and edge-hosted websites, our hosting network (Cloudflare Pages) automatically logs basic network metadata such as IP address, browser user-agent, operating system, and request timestamps strictly for DDOS mitigation, security diagnostics, and service uptime.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
          3. How We Use Collected Information
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          Information submitted to HST is used exclusively for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-400">
          <li>Evaluating, responding to, and following up on commercial or technical inquiries;</li>
          <li>Engaging in partnership or venture collaboration discussions requested by you;</li>
          <li>Maintaining network integrity, fraud prevention, and operational security;</li>
          <li>Complying with applicable legal obligations under local and international statutory laws.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
          4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          Our website does not use tracking cookies for cross-site profiling or behavioral advertising. We do not embed surveillance trackers, marketing pixels, or third-party ad beacons. Essential session storage may be utilized solely for browser accessibility preferences (e.g. reduced motion).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
          5. Data Retention &amp; Security
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          We retain inquiry correspondence only for as long as necessary to fulfill the operational business purpose of the communication or to satisfy legal retention mandates. All digital communications are encrypted in transit using industry-standard TLS (HTTPS) protocols.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-2">
          6. Your Legal Rights
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          Depending on your jurisdiction (such as under the European GDPR or India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act), you have rights regarding your personal information, including the right to request access, correction, or deletion of communications held by HST.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">
          To exercise any privacy rights, contact our privacy desk directly at <a href="mailto:contact@hackerspace.technologies" class="text-hst-red hover:underline font-mono">contact@hackerspace.technologies</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
